message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "TinyML-MLOps Framework for ARM Cortex-M7"
abstract: >-
  An open-source MLOps pipeline to train, compress (pruning + INT8 quantization)
  and deploy deep-learning computer-vision models on resource-constrained
  microcontrollers, including a Hardware-in-the-Loop (HIL) measurement bench for
  on-device inference evaluation on the Arduino Portenta H7.
